{"4443720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Focus With Luna: Cozy Magic Studies", "steam_appid": 4443720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter Your Magical Dormitory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leave the ordinary world behind. Step into a beautifully detailed 3D fantasy room filled with ancient spellbooks, glowing potions, and carved wooden furniture. Watch the snow fall gently outside your grand castle window as you settle in for a quiet session of deep work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/2ccdd5b45131422a9142ce10bbcb2aea.poster.avif?t=1779907666\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/2ccdd5b45131422a9142ce10bbcb2aea.webm?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/2ccdd5b45131422a9142ce10bbcb2aea.mp4?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absolute Control Over Your Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take full command of the weather and lighting to craft your perfect study environment. Whether you want the warmth of a crackling fireplace on a cold winter night, the heavy patter of a thunderstorm, or a calm, snowy evening, you dictate the exact atmosphere outside your academy window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/67a0dc513d9374af2e63049f2ccc68ab.poster.avif?t=1779907666\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/67a0dc513d9374af2e63049f2ccc68ab.webm?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/67a0dc513d9374af2e63049f2ccc68ab.mp4?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stay on track with built-in productivity tools. Use the  timer, manage your daily task lists, and track your progress. Whether you are coding, writing, preparing for exams, or building your own fantasy worlds, <i>Focus With Luna</i> provides a calm, distraction-free space to get your work done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/b9281495aac84f293a05dfde3ca64bfe.poster.avif?t=1779907666\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/b9281495aac84f293a05dfde3ca64bfe.webm?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/b9281495aac84f293a05dfde3ca64bfe.mp4?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Focus &amp; Daily Quests</strong> Stay on track with a built-in suite of tools designed to turn your real-world goals into manageable missions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Focus Timer:</strong> Set a dedicated timer for your work intervals, helping you build discipline, keep your mind sharp, and prevent burnout during long study sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To-Do List &amp; Missions:</strong> Organize your day by breaking down massive projects into clear, actionable tasks. Check off your daily missions as you complete them to build momentum and stay motivated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personal Journal:</strong> Chronicle your thoughts, jot down sudden bursts of inspiration, or reflect on your daily progress in your own private digital diary right at your desk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/35356bb8aba1e387fbed08de51008f97.poster.avif?t=1779907666\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/35356bb8aba1e387fbed08de51008f97.webm?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/35356bb8aba1e387fbed08de51008f97.mp4?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Enchanting Soundtrack</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a curated selection of cinematic instrumental music designed strictly for concentration. From melancholic cello melodies to cozy, ambient fantasy tracks, the audio blends perfectly with the sounds of the academy to keep you inspired and focused without any interruptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/c65d43c40ef021539667aa657fbceef5.poster.avif?t=1779907666\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/c65d43c40ef021539667aa657fbceef5.webm?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/c65d43c40ef021539667aa657fbceef5.mp4?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly detailed, cozy 3D magical dormitory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full, absolute control over dynamic weather and lighting effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in productivity tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive environmental sounds (falling snow, crackling fire, thunderstorms)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic fantasy  ambient tones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distraction-free zone for studying, working, or creating</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter Your Magical Dormitory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leave the ordinary world behind. Step into a beautifully detailed 3D fantasy room filled with ancient spellbooks, glowing potions, and carved wooden furniture. Watch the snow fall gently outside your grand castle window as you settle in for a quiet session of deep work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/2ccdd5b45131422a9142ce10bbcb2aea.poster.avif?t=1779907666\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/2ccdd5b45131422a9142ce10bbcb2aea.webm?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443720/extras/2ccdd5b45131422a9142ce10bbcb2aea.mp4?t=1779907666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absolute Control Over Your Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take full command of the weather and lighting to craft your perfect study environment. Whether you want the warmth of a crackling fireplace on